&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT SINGLESTORE &amp;amp; THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is the Intelligence Platform powering real-time data, analytics, and AI experiences at enterprise scale.&amp;nbsp;Internally, we practice what we preach through our AI &amp;amp; Automation Center of Excellence (CoE): a unit that&amp;nbsp;partners with cross-functional teams to identify high-friction business problems and solve them using AI,&amp;nbsp;automation, and data.&amp;nbsp;As a Senior AI &amp;amp; Automation Manager, you will be overseeing the AI CoE and working directly with executive&amp;nbsp;leadership to tackle the company&#39;s highest-impact problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● AI agent development: Building and refining AI agents (e.g., Glean or custom agents) to automate knowledge&amp;nbsp;retrieval, extract intelligence, and support decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Automation workflows: Design and build automation pipelines to eliminate manual and repetitive processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Data analysis &amp;amp; pipelines: Write Python and SQL to extract, transform, and analyse data from internal&amp;nbsp;systems (Salesforce, data warehouse, etc.), including building scoring and prioritization models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Stakeholder discovery: Engage with cross-functional teams to understand pain points, document&amp;nbsp;requirements, and translate them into structured problem statements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Process improvement: Identify workflow inefficiencies, propose solutions, and drive implementation end-to-end with strong ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Project management: Independently scope, sequence, and deliver technical projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Enablement/Team management: Guide or mentor junior team members on technical execution, and act as&amp;nbsp;the go-to resource for AI/automation capability across the org&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS / SKILLS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of experience in AI, automation, data science or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science Engineering, or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred background in SaaS, particularly working with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Python (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn), able to write scripts for data processing, ELT&amp;nbsp;pipeline, API calls, and automation logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and data skills, with expertise in writing queries and working with data structures,&amp;nbsp;joins, and aggregations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI to build agents that solve real-world use cases using frameworks or custom&amp;nbsp;tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with automation tools such as n8n, Zapier, Make, Workato, or custom-built&amp;nbsp;automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, with the ability to consider data flow, scalability, and downstream&amp;nbsp;impact rather than focusing only on immediate outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Claude Code or similar AI coding assistants to build or configure MCP servers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating third-party systems through APIs and webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to translate ambiguous business problems into&amp;nbsp;structured technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High sense of ownership, self-motivated, able to drive tasks end-to-end, and proactive in&amp;nbsp;dentifying and communicating blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, confident working with non-technical&amp;nbsp;stakeholders, able to present findings clearly, and effective with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is growing our Sales Development team, and we’re looking for hungry, motivated sales development professionals. The SDR team at SingleStore uses outbound prospecting tactics to generate opportunities for our sales team(s). Business development representatives are assigned to account-based territories for commercial, enterprise, and strategic target accounts. This team is a keen group with high business acumen and a hunter&#39;s mentality, comfortable generating their own leads.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate a qualified sales pipeline for SingleStore targeted accounts ($100M - 1BN in annual revenue)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively prospect using phone, email, and social media; 50:50 split between outbound and inbound&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with up to 4 Account Executives on account plans and prospecting strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key account stakeholders to generate opportunities for SingleStore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain open communication and alignment with Account Executives and management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly gain a strong understanding of the SingleStore value proposition and the database industry landscape (prior data experience is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently achieve/exceed the monthly quota of qualified opportunities and meaningful interactions with new prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of SDR (Inbound), or BDR experience in the software industry preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, with the ability to become an expert on database management systems (DBMS) within your first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of running high-volume outbound cadences via phone, email, and social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of achieving measurable lead and pipeline goals; references preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal sales training is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required to be available Tuesdays and Wednesdays for pipeline generation days with the team and overall training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional written and spoken communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry for a career in sales or other areas of enterprise software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable reaching out cold to executive-level and technical prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sales tools like Salesforce, Outreach.io, Zoominfo, and LinkedIn&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized &amp;amp; autonomous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and self-motivated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to partner with and support co-workers and customers across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore delivers the cloud-native database with the speed and scale to power the world’s data-intensive applications. With a distributed SQL database that introduces simplicity to your data architecture by unifying transactions and analytics, SingleStore empowers digital leaders to deliver exceptional, real-time data experiences to their customers. SingleStore is venture-backed and headquartered in San Francisco with offices in Sunnyvale, Raleigh, Seattle, Boston, London, Lisbon, Bangalore, Dublin and Kyiv.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistent with our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion, we value individuals with the ability to work on diverse teams and with a diverse range of people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all recruitment agencies: SingleStore does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to SingleStore employees. SingleStore is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is growing our Sales Development team, and we’re looking for hungry, motivated sales development professionals. The SDR team at SingleStore uses outbound prospecting tactics to generate opportunities for our sales team(s). Business development representatives are assigned to account-based territories for commercial, enterprise, and strategic target accounts. This team is a keen group with high business acumen and a hunter&#39;s mentality, comfortable generating their own leads.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate a qualified sales pipeline for SingleStore targeted accounts ($100M - 1BN in annual revenue)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively prospect using phone, email, and social media; 50:50 split between outbound and inbound&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with up to 4 Account Executives on account plans and prospecting strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key account stakeholders to generate opportunities for SingleStore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain open communication and alignment with Account Executives and management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly gain a strong understanding of the SingleStore value proposition and the database industry landscape (prior data experience is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently achieve/exceed the monthly quota of qualified opportunities and meaningful interactions with new prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of SDR (Inbound), or BDR experience in the software industry preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, with the ability to become an expert on database management systems (DBMS) within your first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of running high-volume outbound cadences via phone, email, and social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of achieving measurable lead and pipeline goals; references preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal sales training is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required to be available Tuesdays and Wednesdays for pipeline generation days with the team and overall training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and German&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional written and spoken communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry for a career in sales or other areas of enterprise software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable reaching out cold to executive-level and technical prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sales tools like Salesforce, Outreach.io, Zoominfo, and LinkedIn&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized &amp;amp; autonomous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and self-motivated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to partner with and support co-workers and customers across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore delivers the cloud-native database with the speed and scale to power the world’s data-intensive applications. With a distributed SQL database that introduces simplicity to your data architecture by unifying transactions and analytics, SingleStore empowers digital leaders to deliver exceptional, real-time data experiences to their customers. SingleStore is venture-backed and headquartered in San Francisco with offices in Sunnyvale, Raleigh, Seattle, Boston, London, Lisbon, Bangalore, Dublin and Kyiv.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistent with our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion, we value individuals with the ability to work on diverse teams and with a diverse range of people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is looking for an accomplished sales professional to join our Sales Team. AI is moving from experimentation into production, and this role is an opportunity to break into AI while doing meaningful enterprise selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, AI Hunter, your job is simple: create new SingleStore customers. You will find companies building AI applications where data access, real-time context, memory, retrieval, or operational scale is becoming a constraint—and turn those challenges into new SingleStore customers. You will own a broad territory, build a majority self-sourced pipeline, create demand in an emerging category, and close greenfield enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true hunting role. You will engage customers before they have a defined project, develop customer-specific points of view, create urgency around business and technical problems, work with technical experts to land first production workloads, and build a measurable new-logo business with broad ownership. The ideal candidate is a measurable enterprise hunter who is competitive, curious, technically credible, resilient, and able to sell business outcomes. Direct AI sales experience is valuable, but proven selling ability and technical curiosity matter more than a narrow “AI seller” title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory strategy for net-new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect fearlessly across a broad account universe using proactive, persistent outbound, account-based, partner, and market-education motions; stay resilient and effective through rejection and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Form account hypotheses, map the buying center, and earn first meetings with relevant points of view tailored to the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage executive, business, technical, security, and procurement stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead great business-first discovery, connect AI and data challenges to fundable goals, and build quantified ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop champions, multi-thread the buying group, earn executive and economic-buyer access, and maintain stakeholder alignment; own the stakeholder plan, mutual action plan, close plan, value case, stage gates, forecast, and commercial outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles through technical validation, security, legal, procurement, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions and Forward Deployment Engineers and cross-functional teams to validate technical fit and establish the first production workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate competitive displacement and maintain disciplined activity management, CRM hygiene, reporting, qualification, forecasting, and opportunity management; showcase clear metrics such as pipeline created, meetings, conversion, quota attainment, and new-logo performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be AI fluent: use AI and research tools productively and responsibly while applying judgment, validating outputs, and separating facts from hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the assigned territory as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quota-carrying B2B enterprise software sales experience, ideally selling to large or technically sophisticated organizations; experience in data, cloud, analytics, AI, or adjacent technical domains is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repeated, quantified quota success with clear ownership of new-logo wins and self-sourced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving executives, technical evaluators, security, legal, finance, procurement, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell measurable business outcomes and build ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in an adjacent domain such as databases, data infrastructure, analytics, AI/ML, cloud, Kubernetes, developer tools, cybersecurity, observability, or open-source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong qualification, account planning, forecasting, CRM, negotiation, and deal-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning velocity and coachability, demonstrated through specific behavior change after feedback; ability to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence, customer trust, resilience, intellectual honesty, and excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A., B.S. degree or equivalent in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Fortune 500 or security-sensitive organizations, cloud ecosystems, open-source or consumption-based products, or emerging categories is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all recruitment agencies: SingleStore does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to SingleStore employees. SingleStore is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SingleStore’s salary range for this role is £60,000 - £90,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;For candidates residing in California, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/singlestore-california-recruitment-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;. For candidates residing in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/recruitment-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; EEA, UK, and Swiss Recruitment Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;vhu9kd&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;17&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;19&quot; data-end=&quot;249&quot;&gt;SingleStore engineers build the real-time data platform that enables some of the world’s most demanding applications. Our cloud-native database architecture enables high-performance transactional and analytical workloads at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;823&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled DevOps/Cloud Platforms Engineer to join our engineering organization and help drive the next generation of our infrastructure and platform capabilities. In this role, you will be responsible for designing, operating, and optimizing cloud environments, maintaining cloud infrastructure, and creating internal developer platforms that support fast, reliable and secure software delivery. You will work closely with engineering, QA, data, and product teams to ensure our systems are scalable, resilient, and easy to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate brings a strong blend of cloud infrastructure expertise, DevOps mindset, and hands-on development skills. You will automate wherever possible, use Infrastructure as Code to maintain consistency, and leverage modern DevOps tooling, including AI-assisted automation to enhance operational efficiency and developer productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1343&quot;&gt;This is an operations role for someone who thrives in solving complex technical problems, improving processes, and building platforms that accelerate engineering velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;Primary Roles and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;2748&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1d3ro02&quot; data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;1523&quot;&gt;Automate infrastructure provisioning, configuration management, monitoring, and operational workflows using IaC and scripting languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15o3b7x&quot; data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;Own the deployment, maintenance, and lifecycle management of systems supporting engineering (Kubernetes clusters, container registries, artifact systems, and internal developer platforms) leveraging deep expertise in Kubernetes, container runtimes, and the broader cloud-native ecosystem (Helm, Kustomize, operators).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ec12af&quot; data-start=&quot;1844&quot; data-end=&quot;1980&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot complex infrastructure and application issues, driving root-cause analysis and developing long-term remediation solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1emiuf2&quot; data-start=&quot;1981&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain cloud infrastructure across major cloud providers (AWS, GCP, Azure), and develop/support deployments of applications, services, and monitoring with a strong focus on scalability, reliability, and cost optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aps1md&quot; data-start=&quot;2226&quot; data-end=&quot;2345&quot;&gt;Develop, enhance, and maintain CI/CD pipelines using modern DevOps tooling (GitHub Actions, ArgoCD, Terraform, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jr5r5l&quot; data-start=&quot;2346&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;Develop internal tooling and automation using Terraform, Python, Go, or similar languages to streamline operational tasks and improve developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;199ofvw&quot; data-start=&quot;2506&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;Implement and manage security best practices across cloud environments, including identity management, secrets handling, audit logging, and network controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;de5vxl&quot; data-start=&quot;2666&quot; data-end=&quot;2748&quot;&gt;Leverage AI/ML tools to automate repetitive DevOps tasks, operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2750&quot; data-end=&quot;2784&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2750&quot; data-end=&quot;2784&quot;&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2786&quot; data-end=&quot;3631&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vhbd8b&quot; data-start=&quot;2786&quot; data-end=&quot;2907&quot;&gt;4-8+ years of experience in DevOps, Cloud Engineering, Systems Administration, or similar infrastructure-focused roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1082uaj&quot; data-start=&quot;2908&quot; data-end=&quot;3042&quot;&gt;Familiar with GIT and comfortable with at least one systems programming language (Golang) and one scripting language (Python, Bash).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1riobtn&quot; data-start=&quot;3043&quot; data-end=&quot;3183&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, Pulumi, or CloudFormation) and configuration management (Ansible, Chef, or SaltStack).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;177ca40&quot; data-start=&quot;3184&quot; data-end=&quot;3329&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of at least one of observability stacks (Prometheus, Grafana, ELK/OpenSearch, Datadog, etc.) and operational troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ah55c8&quot; data-start=&quot;3330&quot; data-end=&quot;3412&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Kubernetes management in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16a5o3z&quot; data-start=&quot;3413&quot; data-end=&quot;3492&quot;&gt;Experience designing, developing, and/or troubleshooting distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7yx0dr&quot; data-start=&quot;3493&quot; data-end=&quot;3539&quot;&gt;Comfort with shells on *nix family systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u54yk&quot; data-start=&quot;3540&quot; data-end=&quot;3631&quot;&gt;B.S. degree or equivalent experience in Engineering, Computer Science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3635&quot; data-end=&quot;3664&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3635&quot; data-end=&quot;3664&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2oyiry&quot; data-start=&quot;3666&quot; data-end=&quot;3752&quot;&gt;Certifications from cloud service providers (e.g., AWS DevOps, GCP DevOps Engineer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o65dp0&quot; data-start=&quot;3753&quot; data-end=&quot;3888&quot;&gt;Strong software development skills, with experience building production-grade services, automation, APIs, and infrastructure tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;la78ca&quot; data-start=&quot;3889&quot; data-end=&quot;3956&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Go, Python, or other modern programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16bairn&quot; data-start=&quot;3957&quot; data-end=&quot;4113&quot;&gt;Strong cloud networking fundamentals, including VPC/VNet, subnets, NAT Gateways, Transit Gateways, routing, DNS, load balancing, and private connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ee7pwd&quot; data-start=&quot;4114&quot; data-end=&quot;4242&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with VPN and secure networking technologies such as Tailscale, Headscale, WireGuard, or similar solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1blf0gv&quot; data-start=&quot;4243&quot; data-end=&quot;4382&quot;&gt;Strong Kubernetes experience, including cluster architecture, networking, service discovery, ingress, observability, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ukthzz&quot; data-start=&quot;4383&quot; data-end=&quot;4514&quot;&gt;Understanding of distributed systems concepts and experience working with highly available, scalable, and fault-tolerant systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17p304d&quot; data-start=&quot;4515&quot; data-end=&quot;4593&quot;&gt;Natural curiosity and a strong drive to learn new and adjacent technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fnmuh9&quot; data-start=&quot;4594&quot; data-end=&quot;4784&quot;&gt;Experience applying AI/ML tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, cloud AI services, LLM-based automation, anomaly detection tools) to streamline DevOps and infrastructure workflows is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16p1tsi&quot; data-start=&quot;4785&quot; data-end=&quot;4916&quot;&gt;Experience with LangChain, AI agents, and MCP (Model Context Protocol), including building and integrating agent-based solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing AI-enhanced threat detection and security systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore delivers our cloud-native database with the speed and scale to power the world’s data-intensive applications. With a distributed SQL database that introduces simplicity to your data architecture by unifying transactions and analytics, SingleStore empowers digital leaders to deliver exceptional, real-time data experiences to their customers. SingleStore is venture-backed and headquartered in San Francisco with offices in Sunnyvale, Raleigh, Seattle, Boston, London, Lisbon, Bangalore, Dublin and Kyiv.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistent with our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion, we value individuals with the ability to work on diverse teams and with a diverse range of people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all recruitment agencies: SingleStore does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to SingleStore employees. SingleStore is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
