&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Force Multiplier:&lt;/strong&gt; Author clear RFCs/architectural design records (ADRs), mentor senior engineers, lead cross-functional reviews, and partner with Product and SRE teams to align roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
