&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Kubernetes Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on mastery of Kubernetes internals, CRDs, custom controller development (client-go/controller-runtime), scheduling dynamics, and container networking/runtime internals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong OO / Systems Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; with an emphasis on concurrent programming, low-latency I/O, and distributed state management.&lt;/li&gt;
