&lt;p&gt;Significant professional experience building and operating production software, typically 10+ years, or equivalent depth of experience and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expert-level experience with Java including the ability to debug and improve complex, long-lived enterprise-grade codebases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using JDBC with one or more databases, including working with SQL metadata, SQL datatypes, schema information, database-specific behavior, connection pooling, SQL execution, Apache Avro, Protocol Buffers, or similar serialization and integration technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of databases and data-intensive systems, including transactions, replication, indexing, connection management, and data consistency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
