&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor engineers and influence outcomes without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s (preferred) degree in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
